<title>POLAND: Largest Polish brewer issues PLN 10.5 mln CPs.</title>
<headline>Largest Polish brewer issues PLN 10.5 mln CPs.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's largest brewery, Elbrewery Company Ltd., controlled by Australia's  Brewpole BV, issued 10.5 million zlotys of commercial paper on Thursday, issue manager ING Bank NV in Warsaw said in a statement.</p>
<p>The commercial paper, called KWIT, was sold for two- and three-month periods with yields of 18.70 and 18.90 percent respectively.</p>
<p>The tranche is part of Elbrewery's 90 million zloty KWIT scheme which began in January 1995.</p>
<p>--Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
